thub.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120231.patch","merged_at":"2026-06-25T13:37:18Z"},"body":"Dear Godot Community,\r\n\r\nWe are contributing visionOS support in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109975. This follow-up fully wires up depth resolve to the Metal rendering driver, enabling MSAA support for the visionOS XR Module (visionOS requires a valid depth texture to render).\r\n\r\nNote, this was independently implemented by @huseindenanhai in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112439 The approach in his implementation is equivalent (thanks!).\r\n\r\n_Disclaimer: Claude Code was used to assist in development. Claude was used to extract the isolated change from a larger change-set, and to assist in rebasing on top of master. The code was written and reviewed by Apple employees, and tested on real hardware before being submitted._","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120231/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https: